dsh-github-mcp README · Minimal presets：> Filter at `system-prompt/assemble` rather than snapshotting `ctx.tools.schemas()` at `apply` time: the plugin registers its tools asynchronously (MCP discovery plus a `ctx.effect` registration), so a one-time snapshot is empty at apply time and no restriction gets installed. Assembly-time filtering is registration-time independent — whatever registered before the request is filtered out.

```js
// restrict-github.js
const name = 'restrict-github';
const inject = ['tools'];

```yaml
